From: joebereczki <41107035-joebereczki@users.noreply.replit.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Feb 2026 07:25:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 127/244] Add ability for users to control bot auto-restart
 behavior

Introduce a new API endpoint and UI elements to manage the `enabled` flag for bots, allowing independent control over auto-restart functionality.

